msgid ""
"VPN client on xray-core with subscriptions and automatic failover between "
"servers."
msgstr ""
"VPN-клиент на xray-core с подписками и автоматическим переключением между "
"серверами."

#: luci-app-xvpn/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/xvpn/status.js:38
